### Configuração Base
@rodarfront=  php -S localhost:3000
@rodarback= php artisan serve 
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = 

### ==========================================
### 1️⃣  REGISTRO - Criar novo usuário
### ==========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "password_confirmation": "password123",
  "organization": "Tech Solutions"
}

### ==========================================
### 2️⃣  LOGIN - Fazer login
### ==========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ==========================================
### 3️⃣  GET ME - Obter dados do usuário logado
### ==========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==========================================
### 4️⃣  UPDATE - Atualizar usuário
### ==========================================
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Updated",
  "organization": "New Organization"
}

### ==========================================
### 5️⃣  LOGOUT - Fazer logout
### ==========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==========================================
### 6️⃣  HOME - Página inicial
### ==========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/
